SUMMARY:Katie Knipp Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:The Melon Ball in Davis presents… \nKatie Knipp is a powerhouse blues and Americana artist from Northern California\, celebrated for her raw\, soul-deep vocals and multi-instrumental fire. A Billboard-charting songwriter and performer\, she blends blues\, Americana\, rock\, and genre-bending experimental edges into a sound that’s unmistakably her own. \nBorn in Alameda and trained in music at Cal State East Bay\, Knipp has built a national reputation through relentless touring and a string of acclaimed releases. Her albums Take It With You (2018)\, The Well (2021)\, Live at The Green Room Social Club (2022)\, and Me (2024) all landed on the Billboard Blues Albums Chart\, with The Well debuting at No. 4. \nA two-time Sacramento Music Award winner for Best Blues Artist (2019\, 2020)\, Knipp has shared stages with legends including Robert Cray\, Jimmie Vaughan\, Joan Osborne\, The Doobie Brothers\, and Ruthie Foster. \nKnown for her electrifying live shows—switching between piano\, slide guitar\, and harmonica—Knipp continues to be one of Sacramento’s most dynamic and nationally recognized musical voices \nWEBSITE\nINSTAGRAM\nFACEBOOK \n$20 General Admission\nDoors open at 7:00pm\nThis is a BYOB event!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/katie-knipp-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, DAVIS\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/KatieKnipp_Website-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
